# Kirk, Man of Action pumps every creature its controller controls with one of the six subtypes +2/+2 (CR 613.4c, layer
# 7c): the Officer, the Artificer, the Doctor, the Pilot and the Scientist each get it; a Soldier gets nothing, and
# neither does an Officer the other player controls (CR 109.5). "Other" leaves Kirk herself out of her own pump even
# though she is an Officer (CR 109.5).
#
# Everything is paid for out of Black Lotus, which is {0} and adds three mana at once (CR 500.4: a pool does not survive
# a step, so a single card paying for itself beats tapping several one-mana sources across steps).

